docs {
  # Force Authenticate Session
  
  **Use this as a workaround** when the browser is on the feed page but `isAuthenticated` is still false.
  
  ## When to Use
  - Login times out but browser is on `/feed`
  - Session status shows `currentUrl: "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/"` but `isAuthenticated: false`
  
  ## Usage
  1. Check session status first
  2. If on `/feed` but not authenticated, use this endpoint
  3. Session will be marked as authenticated
  
  ## Response
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Session marked as authenticated",
    "session": {
      "id": "abc-123",
      "isAuthenticated": true,
      "currentUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Warning
  This is a workaround. The proper fix is to ensure login completes without timeout.
}
